# landmark (assets/world3d/toll-bridge/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# The Toll Bridge to Nowhere: a great stone arch carrying a bridge deck across
# the road's end between the two toll houses, a toll board and lamps on it.
arch-12  stone   at 192 0 2 size 96 52 24 id toll-arch
box      stone   at 192 52 2 size 118 5 26 id toll-deck
box      stone   at 192 57 13 size 118 5 3 id toll-parapet-front
